title: "uMCP — Unified MCP Security Framework"
abstract: "A privacy-preserving security framework for AI agents built on the Model Context Protocol (MCP), providing transparent dual-plane anonymization, a blockchain-like audit trail, and plug-and-play tooling for healthcare, finance, and other regulated domains."
